From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tangenx <me@tangenx.dev>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:39:19 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [chat] fix regressions

Fix saved-draft browser startup, add photo-picker draft saving and a latest-draft shortcut, and consistently hide reply/forward actions for retained deleted messages in skip mode.

Confidence: medium

Scope-risk: moderate

Not-tested: signed-in draft and deleted-reply UI flows need manual retest
